# syntax=ghcr.io/railwayapp/railpack-frontend:0.39.0
# Joint control image (runner binary + UI) built from railpack.json at the
# repo root via plain buildx — push, cache, and multi-arch all work as usual:
#   docker buildx build -f docker/Dockerfile.railpack -t <tag> --push .
# The frontend version tracks the railpack CLI (mise). Local dev keeps the
# explicit Dockerfiles (compose.yaml) — this file is Coolify/CI only.
